VOIDED as a closure baseline — 2026-07-26, by decision of the project owner.

WHY: this cycle was an UNINTENDED live run. The command
    python3 biweekly_recon.py --create-ticket
was prefix-matched by argparse to the compat alias --create-tickets (apply=True), and the
confirmation guard of the time read `if args.yes or not sys.stdin.isatty(): return` —
treating "no terminal" as "no confirmation needed". A 2-minute timeout killed it mid-loop.

