SCTASK0010190-, against dev336362. These duplicate the 30 chains from cycle_20260723_002630.
The chains were deliberately LEFT IN PLACE (owner's decision): no further ServiceNow writes
were made. Close or cancel them manually if/when desired; tickets.jsonl lists every
correlation_id, REQ, RITM and SCTASK, and logs/20260727T021939Z-3160483.changes.jsonl holds
all 116 mutating calls with full request/response bodies.

EFFECT OF THIS FILE: scripts/biweekly_recon.py::load_prev_state skips any cycle directory
containing a VOID file, so this run can never become the closure baseline. Without it, the
next real cycle would age every finding here to 2 ("escalated"), report 0 new, and take its
roster counts as the sanity-check reference.

The evidence is retained, not deleted: the audit trail must show that this run happened and
was excluded on purpose.

